ok - a remote-seeded secondmate home allocates and launches from its Treehouse pool
ok - a Treehouse slot claim names the launched task, refuses when unclaimable, and is dropped by a locked abort
ok - a launch refused after its slot claim leaves the pool for a retry and a second task
ok - a refused polytoken launch leaves its per-id paths alone while another spawn holds the per-id lock
ok - a non-polytoken launch refused after its slot claim keeps main's abort behavior
not ok - a codex spawn whose slot stopped being isolated should refuse
